  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRHR lawyers E Europe</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SRHR-jurister &#xd6;st</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett antal jurister f&#xe5;r utbildning i reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa f&#xf6;r att kunna driva s&#xe5;dana fall till domstol i sina heml&#xe4;nder i &#xd6;steuropa. Utbildningen genomf&#xf6;rs av den amerikanska NGOn Center for Reproductive Rights under en tv&#xe5;&#xe5;rsperiod.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project intends to convene lawyers from countries in the ECA region twice a year to carry out targeted training in, among other gender-related human rights, reproductive rights. This training will be done through the establishment of a Women&apos;s Human Rights Institute with professional legal input from experts from the NGO Center for Reproductive Rights.</narrative>
  </description>
